          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE 5/323 21/12/73 WESTON TURVILLE MAIN STREET north side No.3 Old Thatched Cottage GV II Cottage. C17 altered. Timber framed with colourwashed brick infill and refacing. Thatched roof, half hipped to west, brick chimney, eyebrow dormer to RH. 1-storey and attic, door in centre of N. elevation with 3-light casement to RH, smaller 2-light to LH with shutters. Recent 1-storey extension at E. end, brick with tiled roof. RCHM I.p.316. MON.6. Listing NGR: SP8532110809"
    }
